{"id":"658652","name":"蜂蜜鸡蛋麻花","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/658652/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"130g"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"35g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"双酵泡打粉","amount":"2g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"加入各种食材。","img":"images/658652/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"再加入牛奶搅拌成絮状，再加入食用油。","img":"images/658652/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"和成软硬适度的面团覆膜饧发。","img":"images/658652/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面饧发好揉至光滑。","img":"images/658652/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"分成均等的小剂子。","img":"images/658652/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搓成条状。","img":"images/658652/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"每次我都炸双股麻花，此次搓成单股麻花。","img":"images/658652/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"二次饧发完成。","img":"images/658652/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中放入食用油，用中小火慢慢炸(火大易焦)。","img":"images/658652/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炸至金黄即可。","img":"images/658652/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"此次麻花卖相不太好看，但囗感外酥里软，家人一致认为口感“好吃”。","img":"images/658652/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}